  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Requires Umbraco CMS 18.0+. This release will not install on Umbraco 17 - the 1.x line on the main branch continues to be maintained separately for Umbraco 17.\n\n- Fixed the items column on UmbracoMediaAuditDeletionLog truncating/rejecting inserts on SQL Server once a delete/purge batch's JSON payload exceeds 255 characters. Widened to nvarchar(max) for new installs, with a migration step to widen it for existing installs too.\n\nFull release notes: https://github.com/ProWorksCorporation/ProWorks.Umbraco.MediaAudit/releases/tag/v18.0.2",
